---
Show this message, or the help of one command.

Usage: ink help [TOPIC]...

Examples
  # The exit codes
  ink help exit

  # What a decision or diagnostic code means
  ink help page.title

Arguments
  [TOPIC]...  A command (`deploy rollback`), `exit`,
              `environment`, or a diagnostic or decision
              code

Exit codes
  0  Done; warnings, if any, were printed
  1  The site has errors
  2  Wrong usage, or a folder that is missing; nothing was
     changed

Docs    https://github.com/uses-ink/uses.ink/blob/main/docs/cli.md
Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log,
        --log-file (see `ink --help`)
